              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Donna Kepner-Wynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used only 2 avocados. I needed to use more sea salts for flavor ( I blended Hickory/Maldon Flakes/ Morton Lite salt ALL) also needed more Garlic powder &amp; added pieces of Jalapeno . Once I got it right for me, I ate the entire thing",
            "datePublished": "2019-07-06T21:50:33.113Z"
