            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is pretty close to perfect guacamole for me. I don't always like to add tomatoes, but that's an easy fix. I used one tomato when I made it this time. I didn't have lime juice, but lemon worked just fine. I omitted the sea salt and garlic powder and used 1 tsp garlic salt. Made as written or with a few tweaks, you can't go wrong with this recipe.",
